forcal_picker_use_module = Module
forcal_picker_use_yform = The field forcal_picker is available in the table manager. In pipe notation: name, label, type, multiple (0/1), maximum, category ID, online only (0/1), past (0/1).
forcal_picker_ref_perm = Who may use the picker: users with “use forCal” choose from their categories and may create events there. The permission “FORCal choose in the picker” (forcal[pick]) allows choosing from all categories without being allowed to maintain events.
